  "worked_solution": "Using the result \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})=\\text{sign}(w),\n$$\n\n we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(-2(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}+12) \\\\  & =-2\\cdot {∇}_{w}((‖w{‖}_{1})^{2})+{∇}_{w}(12) \\\\  & =-2\\cdot 2\\cdot ‖w{‖}_{1}\\cdot {∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})+0 \\\\  & =-4‖w{‖}_{1}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
